1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:02,888
Name?

2
00:00:02,928 --> 00:00:04,387
Cleo.

3
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:06,618
Experience with evil?

4
00:00:06,658 --> 00:00:08,990
I worked retail.

5
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,534
Ooh.

6
00:00:10,574 --> 00:00:12,190
Greatest weakness?

7
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:14,414
I press buttons.

8
00:00:14,454 --> 00:00:18,066
Then whatever you do,
do NOT press the—

9
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:23,142
You didn't even hesitate.

10
00:00:23,182 --> 00:00:25,871
You said "whatever I do."

11
00:00:25,911 --> 00:00:29,325
You're hired!

12
00:00:29,365 --> 00:00:31,164
Do I get dental?

13
00:00:31,204 --> 00:00:33,928
You get a fire extinguisher.

14
00:00:34,898 --> 00:00:37,466
Not again!
